/-!
# 20-Tick Entry & Archive Semantics (`EnterJ20`, `ArchiveJ20`, `Archive150`)

1. **`EnterJ20`**: Instantiates `EnterProof17` with `k = 20` and `b = sbP20 (start20 j)` across
   all 9 twenty-tick blocks (`j : Fin 10`, `s = 165, 185, ..., 325`):
   - `from_full`, `ready_from_cut_at`, `ready_pending_at`, `high_from_cut`, `return_packed`,
     and `return_pending` for `enterP20 j` / `enterInvP20 j`.
2. **`ArchiveJ20`**: Instantiates `ArchivePortAction.packet` for all 9 twenty-tick archives
   `archiveLoadP20 j d` / `archiveRestoreP20 j d` (`start20 j + 20`, flags `nextE0_20 + 6..8`):
   - `load_run`, `restore_run`, `roundtrip`, `head_port_eq`, and `kept_stock`.
3. **`Archive150`**: Instantiates `ArchivePortAction.packet` for the `s = 150 -> 165` transition
   archive `archiveLoad150To20 d` / `archiveRestore150To20 d` (tick `165`, flags `e0P20 165 + 6..8`):
   - `load_run`, `restore_run`, `roundtrip`, `head_port_eq`, and `kept_stock`.
-/

namespace ECDSAAdd.Entrant.StairPacket.Shadow20

