/-!
# 20-Tick Shadow Leave Boundary Rails, Boundary Clean, Released Origin & Frame History (`Shadow7Wide20CutB3`)

Proves the boundary semantics for all 9 twenty-tick leave blocks (`j : Fin 10`, `s = 165, 185, ..., 325`):
1. `wide20`, `short20`, `highZero20`, `boundaryRails20`: low and high rails after `leaveP20 j` match
   the stock reference `origin (start20 j) (prevLen20 j) 20 raw history`.
2. `reloc20_chain_geo`, `src20_chain`, `src20_top`, `src20_flags_back`, `src20_out`: closed-form
   relocation inverse for the 20-stride `movesP20 (start20 j)` chain.
3. `zeros20`, `boundaryClean20`: every retired scratch/B-top wire in `zeros20 j` is `false` after `leaveP20 j`.
4. `releasedSite20`, `leftovers20`, `releasedOrigin20`, `releasedActual20`, `frameHistory20`:
   all released and leftover sites agree with `origin (start20 j) (prevLen20 j) 20 raw history`.
-/

