/-!
Trailing 15-tick shadow blocks (`j : Fin 4`, `s ∈ {365, 380, 395, 410}`, margin 17,
tight cutoff `sb15E s = (497 - s) / 2` giving `66, 58, 51, 43`, exiting at tick `425`):
- `IntegerPacket` routing, counts, physicality, domain coverage, and semantic roundtrip.
- 15-tick shadow envelope (`SmallIfFar`, `EndSmall`), algebraic reduction, archive suffix row
  membership into the shared 63,145-row 10-tick archive table, and high-bank restoration laws.
- Physical wire geometry and `CRTBarrel` instantiation for all 4 widths `{65, 58, 50, 43}`.
-/

namespace ECDSAAdd.Entrant.StairPacket.Shadow15End
open ECDSAAdd.Arithmetic ECDSAAdd.Arithmetic.MappedCompressed ECDSAAdd.Entrant.IntegerPacket
open ECDSAAdd.Entrant.StairPacket ECDSAAdd.Entrant.StairPacket.Partial ECDSAAdd.Entrant.StairPacket.GateMirror
