section
/-!
Exit-425 park & archive boundary (`ParkEndpoint425` + `ArchiveBoundary425`):
- `ParkEndpoint425`: parks the 3 shadow flags of trailing block `3` (`s = 410..424`, `e015E 425 = 1610`)
  from `[1616, 1617, 1618]` to `bTopP 425 + 1..3 = [874, 875, 876]`.
- `ArchiveBoundary425`: exact 157-wire archive load/restore boundary at tick `425`
  (`cellsLoadP 425 = ticks 415..424 = bank 83`, flags `[874, 875, 876]`,
  `scratchX 425 = 1556..1642 (87) ++ 877..923 (47)`), reusing `Shadow7.exitLoadP 425` and
  `Shadow7.exitRestoreP 425` with exact `PartialCosts` metrics (`42/50/51 T`, `49/43/44 M`).
-/

namespace ECDSAAdd.Entrant.StairPacket.ParkEndpoint425
open ECDSAAdd.Arithmetic ECDSAAdd.Entrant.StairPacket ECDSAAdd.Entrant.StairPacket.Partial
open ECDSAAdd.Entrant.StairPacket.GateMirror ECDSAAdd.Entrant.StairPacket.ArchivePortAction
